      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRINDLE SURPRISE (6) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 2 length win at Sale in a handy 28.63. Awkwardly drawn but goes well at this distance. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Looks the one to beat. PAW HARKONNEN (4) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (23.81) at this track in a Mix 3/4 over 410m. Leading player again. BLACKPOOL WINTER (8) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (26.26) at Geelong behind Lush Hour in a Grade 4/5. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and two minor placings from seven starts. Can feature again. MEPUNGA LILLY (2) warrants respect following a recent placing at big odds.",
